---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
kicker: Contact
heading: Get in <em>touch</em>
subtitle: Questions about a lab, coaching, an event, or bringing Practice Labs to your team. Send a note and we’ll write back.
description: Reach Red Thread Labs by email, phone or a free conversation with JD in Salt Lake City.
header: { image: "img/pomegranate-plate.jpg", position: "50% 62%", zoom: 1 }
permalink: /contact/
---
{#- The form is handled by Netlify Forms. Each message is emailed to site.email once
    "Form notifications" are turned on in Netlify (Site configuration → Forms → Form notifications).
    The list of ways to reach us comes from _data/site.js; anything left empty there is skipped. -#}
{%- set ways = [
  { label: "Email", text: site.email, href: "mailto:" + site.email },
  { label: "Phone", text: site.phone, href: ("tel:" + (site.phone | replace(" ", ""))) if site.phone else "" },
  { label: "Book a free conversation", text: "Pick a time on Calendly", href: site.bookingUrl },
  { label: "Instagram · Red Thread Labs", text: "@red.thread.labs", href: site.instagram },
  { label: "Instagram · JD", text: "@jaidy.93", href: site.instagramPersonal },
  { label: "LinkedIn · Red Thread Labs", text: "Red Thread Labs", href: site.linkedin },
  { label: "LinkedIn · JD", text: "JD Carlston", href: site.linkedinPersonal },
  { label: "Facebook", text: "Red Thread Labs", href: site.facebook },
  { label: "Mail", text: site.mailingAddress, href: "", plain: true }
] -%}
{% include "partials/page-header.njk" %}
<main id="main" class="reading">
  <div class="reading__inner contact">
    <div class="contact__intro">
      <h2 class="contact__heading">Reach us <em>directly</em></h2>
      <ul class="ways">
        {%- for w in ways %}{% if w.text and (w.href or w.plain) %}
        <li>
          <span class="label">{{ w.label }}</span>
          {%- if w.href %}
          <a href="{{ w.href }}"{% if w.href.startsWith("http") %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ w.text }}</a>
          {%- else %}
          <span>{{ w.text }}</span>
          {%- endif %}
        </li>
        {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <form class="contact-form" name="contact" method="POST" action="/contact/thanks/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
      <p class="sr-only"><label>Leave this empty: <input name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></p>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="name">Your name</label>
        <input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="email">Your email</label>
        <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="phone">Your phone <span class="field__optional">(optional)</span></label>
        <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel">
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="topic">What’s it about?</label>
        <select id="topic" name="topic">
          <option>Practice Labs and events</option>
          <option>Coaching</option>
          <option>Planning an event or ceremony</option>
          <option>Bringing Practice Labs to a team</option>
          <option>Something else</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="message">Message</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="7" required></textarea>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Send message</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</main>
